# VS Code User settings, not here.

# Claude Code
# Shared and portable -> committed:  CLAUDE.md, .claude/settings.json,
#                                    .claude/rules/, .claude/skills/, .claude/agents/
# Machine-specific    -> ignored:    everything below.
.claude/settings.local.json
CLAUDE.local.md

# Working notes, plans, and decision records. Deliberately NOT committed:
# this repo is public and .status/ holds half-formed thinking. The consequence
# is that it lives on one machine only and is absent from fresh clones and
# from `claude --worktree` worktrees.
.status/
